<title>SINGAPORE: Pengkalen Investments posts 1996/97 loss.</title>
<headline>Pengkalen Investments posts 1996/97 loss.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for year ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Loss		  9.84	vs	13.35</p>
<p>    Group shares (cts)   (0.41)     vs	(0.56)</p>
<p>    Turnover		 81.96	vs     106.20</p>
<p>    Other income	    2.25	vs	 0.48</p>
<p>    Interest expense     (4.83)     vs	(3.85)</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   (4.02)     vs	(5.29)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss	   11.07	vs	15.42</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	(2.16)     vs	(9.63)</p>
<p>    Minorities		1.23	vs	 2.06</p>
<p>Note - Pengkalen Investments is a unit of diversified food group Pengkalen Holdings Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
